# AMO (addons.mozilla.org) API credentials, for `web-ext sign`.
#
# Get them at https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/developers/addon/api/key/
# while signed in with the Firefox Account that owns
# cardmarket-bulk-import@jannikhenke.dev. The page labels them exactly this:
#
#   "JWT issuer"  -> WEB_EXT_API_KEY   (looks like  user:12345678:123)
#   "JWT secret"  -> WEB_EXT_API_SECRET (a long hex string)
#
# THE SECRET IS SHOWN ONCE. If you lose it you must regenerate, which
# invalidates the old pair. `web-ext` picks both up from the environment
# automatically — the names below are not arbitrary, they are the
# WEB_EXT_<OPTION> convention for the --api-key/--api-secret flags.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.signing` (gitignored) and fill it in.

WEB_EXT_API_KEY=""
WEB_EXT_API_SECRET=""
